WEBVTT

00:05:57.621 --> 00:06:04.371
I did I did realize it to the extent that
a child can, which is somewhat limited.

00:06:04.913 --> 00:06:10.288
I was born into a house
of really extremes.

00:06:10.288 --> 00:06:16.621
On one hand, I had this mother who was
very loving and very kind hearted

00:06:16.621 --> 00:06:23.288
and warm and optimistic and in so many
ways communicated to me and my my older.

00:06:23.288 --> 00:06:25.163
I have an older sister who's
three years older and

00:06:25.163 --> 00:06:27.079
a younger brother who's about
three years younger.

00:06:27.454 --> 00:06:32.329
And she always communicated to us that
sense of of wonder and love and light